      "rationale": "A common environmental variable might affect both pendulum length and resonator acoustic properties, but a three‑day delayed response is not documented in our environmental logs and would require an undocumented thermal inertia mechanism.",
      "evidenceFor": ["nb_corr"],
      "evidenceAgainst": ["env_log_absent"]
    },
    {
